# Hero doodles — frozen positions

All hero doodle placement (Trackit logo, cursor, money) lives in **`src/app/hero-doodles.css`** only.

## Rules

- **Do NOT** add, move, or duplicate doodle CSS in `landing.css` or elsewhere.
- **Do NOT** change `top`, `margin-left`, `width`, or `z-index` on `.hero-doodle`, `.hero-cursor`, `.hero-money` (or their `--fr` variants) unless the user **explicitly** asks to reposition doodles.
- Safe to edit in `landing.css`: hero padding, headline typography, pill banner, layout — as long as doodle selectors are not touched.
- Scroll parallax in `TrackitLanding.tsx` (`translateY` on scroll) is intentional; do not remove unless asked.

## To reposition doodles

Edit **`src/app/hero-doodles.css`** only. Keep one media-query block per breakpoint (768px, 480px) — no duplicates.
